  "id": "disruptive-mood-dysregulation-disorder",
  "term": "disruptive mood dysregulation disorder",
  "definition": "Disruptive mood dysregulation disorder is a mental health condition in children or adolescents marked by persistent irritability or anger along with frequent, intense temper outbursts. These symptoms are more severe than an ordinary bad mood.",
